# Generated documentation artifacts. scripts/gen_docs.sh builds the manuals (*.html is already
# ignored above) plus a PROVENANCE stamp; composer.scripts.cvlr_docs_manifest turns the Solana
# manual into the public cvlr_kb manifest. Both are rebuildable from the public docs repo, and
# committing them would create a second copy that silently goes stale.
scripts/prover-docs/PROVENANCE
scripts/cvlr-docs/
scripts/cvlr-crates/
